{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_015_02_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1323f1ce4bf72484ae348d12823a4f1156f7601ac42d40f28f203bdb24d9042f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bf2460743361b38e603347657ffc9cc0cad555d02a6aa33b2f7f152f3766629",
      "text": "启航，驶向名为偶像的汪洋",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46f368456c1c589448eb3c75a5c4ef9af94203b886a34aa840d111236820d16a",
      "text": "无法很好地向人们传达深爱的海洋的魅力，克里斯为此苦恼不已。就在这时，通过与制作人的相遇，他开始考虑将偶像这条道路，作为让大家对海洋产生兴趣的手段。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bf2460743361b38e603347657ffc9cc0cad555d02a6aa33b2f7f152f3766629",
      "text": "启航，驶向名为偶像的汪洋",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69b64fe706e26f9ce834d8adb851fe8f462d0099a3741d1b04401c6b94c1f4dc",
      "text": "下次讲座要用的资料……\n记得，好像是收拾在这边了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5eae845056359bda1593f4e306573b930ab43a341cc310f63e03430ea720b3d",
      "text": "（……要把海洋的壮丽传达给学生们，\n还真是相当困难呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6051c3972570b7398646a694488f4fefc2dce63b1e2f002dd628ea5448a6f3e0",
      "text": "（哪怕在所有陆地都被踏遍的现代，\n海洋，也依然是未知的边疆）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:316a68797e9c20132fc45376cde433df08e1fa0a513ac620a210eae7977ca32e",
      "text": "（深入了解那样的海洋，\n并将其魅力广泛传播给世人）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8ecaca6bdda2e35d88d1da266a98e4cc74e35e5013f01264b23af7c4dde33b9",
      "text": "（怀着这样的想法，虽然成为了大学的教师……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4d024d99b7483d57ec9b13e6fd927e5fb400452ecd07ab7dcdf30d2c90cc2aa",
      "text": "（但今天的讲座也是空座显眼。\n学生们的评价，也不尽如人意）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aad6b11483845f48d050a8285c82dfbcc07b14997b1ce9b0372d068ae11461e1",
      "text": "到底该怎么做，才能让大家\n产生兴趣呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc35b7f7e4c709d54a98b624dfadda85b7ea6511da4d377780c4e99bc157924b",
      "text": "……如果答案能轻易得出，就不必这么辛苦了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ae9943a9102bd647db39bdef9e5bd398931766fe4b42a3289f666f9eddb99a4",
      "text": "（这张研讨班招生的海报，\n虽然我觉得完成度不错）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:100fa9ad05cccf64951ffc2342a96187ebe132c11a4af56c5c7b7f57570a8d2b",
      "text": "（但究竟能起到多大效果呢。\n……还是不要抱太大期望比较好吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
